00","children":"Coverage"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"m-0 min-w-0 text-ink-900 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]","children":"7 bodies with project detail and 1 line for the Student Affairs Division. FY 2568 has organisation lines only."}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"grid gap-0 py-[var(--space-2)] border-t border-line","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"m-0 font-bold text-ink-900","children":"Timeliness"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"m-0 min-w-0 text-ink-900 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]","children":"The report is undated. The release date comes from the minutes."}]]}]]}],["$","h3",null,{"id":"$undefined","className":"m-0 mb-[var(--space-2)] text-lg","style":"$undefined","children":"Committee opinion"}],["$","blockquote",null,{"className":"m-0 mb-[var(--space-2)] max-w-[var(--measure-en)] border-l-4 border-line-strong pl-[var(--space-4)]","lang":"th","children":"เห็นควรให้สภานักศึกษาฯ องค์การนักศึกษาฯ ชุมนุม และกลุ่มอิสระ ขอรับงบประมาณสนับสนุนในการจัดกิจกรรมเพิ่มมากขึ้นเนื่องจากกิจกรรมนักศึกษาเป็นกลไกสำคัญในการเสริมสร้างทักษะ ประสบการณ์ และความสัมพันธ์ระหว่างนักศึกษา"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"m-0 max-w-[var(--measure-en)] text-ink-600","children":"In English: the committee considers that the council, the Student Union, the clubs and the independent groups should request more funding for activities, because student activities are an important way to build skills, experience and relationships between students (report page 18; the same opinion is in the minutes, item 4.1)."}]]}]
